              <name>DecorationsThereAreGoodsForRegistrationOfWarehouseActsInventoryLists</name>
              <id>234</id>
              <title>
                <key>en</key>
                <value>Inventory adjustments were not created for all discrepancies. &lt;link vapfwy>Create&lt;/>
This document is recorded in &lt;link wafyva>physical inventory registers&lt;/> for 3 companies. You need to &lt;link fyvayv>generate&lt;/> physical inventory registers for 1 company.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>fa</key>
                <value>تعدیلات موجودی برای همه مغایرت‌ها ایجاد نشدند. &lt;link vapfwy>ایجاد&lt;/>
این سند در &lt;link wafyva>دفاتر ثبت شمارش فیزیکی موجودی&lt;/> برای 3 شرکت ثبت شده است. باید دفاتر ثبت شمارش فیزیکی موجودی را برای 1 شرکت &lt;link fyvayv>ایجاد کنید&lt;/>.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>ru</key>
                <value>Не по всем расхождениям оформлены складские акты. &lt;link vapfwy>Оформить&lt;/>
Этот документ учитывается в &lt;link wafyva>инвентаризационных описях&lt;/> по 3 организациям. Необходимо &lt;link fyvayv>сформировать&lt;/> описи по 1 организации.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>tr</key>
                <value>Tüm tutarsızlıklar için stok düzeltmeleri düzenlenmemiştir.&lt;link vapfwy>Düzenle.&lt;/>
 Bu belge 3 iş yeri için &lt;link wafyva>envanter kayıtlarında dikkate&lt;/> alınmaktadır. 1 iş yeri&lt;link fyvayv> için envanter oluşturulması&lt;/> gerekmektedir.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>vi</key>
                <value>Không phải tất cả chênh lệch đều được lập biên bản kho. &lt;link vapfwy>Lập biên bản kho&lt;/>
Chứng từ này được ghi nhận vào &lt;link wafyva>bản kiểm kê&lt;/> theo 3 doanh nghiệp. Cần &lt;link fyvayv>lập&lt;/> bản kiểm kê theo 1 doanh nghiệp.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>it</key>
                <value>Inventory adjustments were not created for all discrepancies. &lt;link vapfwy>Create&lt;/>
This document is recorded in &lt;link wafyva>physical inventory registers&lt;/> for 3 companies. You need to &lt;link fyvayv>generate&lt;/> physical inventory registers for 1 company.</value>
              </title>
              <title>
                <key>pl</key>
                <value>Inventory adjustments were not created for all discrepancies. &lt;link vapfwy>Create&lt;/>
